<title>USA: GOLF-SINGLES DRAW FOR SUNDAY'S FINAL PRESIDENTS CUP MATCHES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SINGLES DRAW FOR SUNDAY'S FINAL PRESIDENTS CUP MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>GAINESVILLE, Virginia 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singles draw for</p>
<p>Sunday's final day of competition in the President Cup</p>
<p>matches, which the United States led by 10-1/2 points to 9-1/2</p>
<p>against the International team (U.S. players named first):</p>
<p>Mark Brooks vs Craig Parry</p>
<p>David Duval vs Peter Senior</p>
<p>Mark O'Meara vs Nick Price</p>
<p>Kenny Perry vs David Frost</p>
<p>Steve Stricker vs Robert Allenby</p>
<p>Scott Hoch vs Mark McNulty</p>
<p>Davis Love vs Masashi &quot;Jumbo&quot; Ozaki</p>
<p>Justin Leonard vs Steve Elkington</p>
<p>Phil Mickelson vs Ernie Els</p>
<p>Corey Pavin vs Greg Norman</p>
<p>Tom Lehman vs Frank Nobilo</p>
<p>Fred Couples vs Vijay Singh</p>
</text>
